# Break swaps two sounding parts for two quiet ones.
# Back restores that music. It does not return to a closed-filter breakdown.
# SEQ opens the live steps. The form still drops a part for one bar on its own.
# The PRESETS dial steps dark drum and bass, reggae, study trance, meditation,
# then disco, funk, electro, house, hip hop, garage, dubstep, wave and sleep.
seed 42
reboot
wait 200
expect iamstyle 0
expect iamsec 0
expect iammask 65
expect sec 0
expect par49 0
# Break: the pad and the hat step out. The haze and the kick step in. Wood dust at 28.
tap SAVE
wait 4000
expect iamsec 3
expect sec 0
expect iammask 0x18
expect par0 0
expect par58 0
expect par4 28
expect par49 >40
wait 1500
expect sec 0
expect par49 >40
# The dial: reggae is a one-drop, not a snare wall.
turn PRESET 1
wait 4000
expect iamstyle 1
expect iamsec 1
expect playing 1
expect tempo >78
expect tempo <86
expect par72 4
expect par84 15
expect par85 4
expect par86 6
expect par87 6
expect par88 6
expect par40 7
expect par10 18
expect par92 3
expect par93 1
expect par13 52
expect par15 6
expect par19 0
expect par52 0
expect iamlvl3 50
expect par20 1
expect par21 58
expect par22 12
